class.description:
A [PreloadList] names resources for [ResourceDatabase]: direct references ([member resources]), paths ([member paths]) and file manifests ([member manifests]), plus optional keys ([member keys]). Hand it to [method ResourceDatabase.preload_list], or save it as a resource and add its path to [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/resources/preload_lists] to preload it at startup.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var list := PreloadList.new()
list.paths = PackedStringArray(["res://items/sword.tres"])
list.keys = { "hero_sword": "res://items/sword.tres" }
ResourceSaver.save(list, "res://preload/items.tres")
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
var list = new PreloadList();
list.Paths = ["res://items/sword.tres"];
list.Keys = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary<string, string> { { "hero_sword", "res://items/sword.tres" } };
ResourceSaver.Save(list, "res://preload/items.tres");
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
